ds, ammo, and equipment.\r\n4742becd: Go back to the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~\r\n4d1c5c63: Ammu-Nation\r\n5044bf86: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n505db1ce: Leave the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~\r\n53071e9a: You can get ~b~sticky bombs~b~ from Yasmani ~1b~ or by purchasing them at an Ammu-Nation ~2b~\r\n5628cf48: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n570b9b2b: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n584f2e8a: Rob the Ammu-Nation\r\n589f7a58: PHIL'S AMMU-NATION~n~The Trigger Happy Reader Discount Saves You Money & Gets You Laid!\r\n5e6f4f53: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n63901cb6: Donnie will pay for any ~b~narcotics~b~, ~b~jewelry~b~ and ~b~marked bills~b~ dropped off at his trailer.\r\n67a853b3: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n67d3dc55: Recover owned longarms and manage your loadout from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or at an Ammu-Nation weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~\r\n6ada8f29: Subscribe to GTA+ today and get discounts on all ammo in Ammu-Nations.\r\n6e2f03cc: Buy 3 sidearms and 3 longarms from Ammu-Nation.\r\n70a8bb36: Sawed-off shotgun haphazardly repaired with electrical tape. Purchased at Zenon's Pawn Shop in La Perle.\r\n70ac6b05: Had to get a medium freshwater lure from Phil's Ammu-Nation.\r\n71474a61: One-off tactical rifle with a modern forest camo design, purchased from Barrage Gun Supply in Southwind.\r\n75015f5f: Jason retrieves a package Donnie mistakenly dropped out in the Grassrivers when he was drunk.\r\n7d65545f: Tactical Outlet Guns\r\n7ec4ae6c: Phil's Ammu-Nation\r\n800cfaea: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n8652bc84: Brian will pay for any ~b~narcotics~b~, ~b~jewelry~b~ and ~b~marked bills~b~ dropped off at his lockup.\r\n873937b6: Ammu-Nations only accept cash ~BLIP_STYLE_CASH_TYPE_POCKET~ for minor purchase