ome work, let me know. Here's my spot.\r\nc55e8891: Tactical Outlet Guns\r\nc73e952c: Phil's Ammu-Nation\r\nc7f1b067: Ammu-Nations\r\nc8895c73: Cal has left a surprise for Jason with Joey. Speak with him at his garage in Key Lento.\r\ncc730b88: Cal and Jason drive to Hamlet to recover a payment owed to Brian. It's in the trunk of an Imponte Phoenix at the police impound. Jason rescues the car, takes it to Pay 'n' Spray, and drops it at Brian's storage.\r\nd0b48b3f: Donnie Recover Drop\r\nd22eff87: Ammu-Nation\r\nd273288b: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd5c6c443: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd7856045: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd882639d: ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ weapons are now available. Pick them up from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or at an Ammu-Nation ~1b~ weapon locker.\r\ne3c25cdc: ~b~Ammu-Nations~b~ sell guns, mods, ammo, and more.\r\ne4d917af: Hey this is Joey from Coastal Auto Care. Cal mentioned your car might need some work, let me know. Here's my spot.\r\ne8f0f4ec: ~b~Tip:~b~ Use a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~ at an Ammu-Nation to recover owned weapons and manage your loadout.\r\neaa187b3: A new ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ unique weapon variant ~BLIP_STYLE_PICKUP_WEAP_COLLECT~ is available at any Ammu-Nation weapon locker.\r\neab842ac: Donnie's Drop\r\nec632eb7: Work with Cal to recover a car from a police impound lot for Brian.\r\nf46af3cd: Make an Ammu-Nation Purchase\r\nf4a4149a: Donnie got a signal from a missing drug drop somewhere in Pelican Valley. Find the package and drop it off safely.\r\nf613ed62: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nf7556551: Kenton, the treasure hunter you met at Brian's, has work available. Drop by his place in Key Lento.\r\nf7dadd50: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nf7deac2b: ~b~Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STY